{"page":20118,"part":1,"text":"写大字法\n\n\n写大字法\n\n古人作大字常藏锋用力，故其字画从颠至末，少有枯燥处。今往往多以燥理为奇，殊不知此本非善书者所贵，惟斜拂及挈笔令轻处，然后有此，所谓侧笔取妍，正蹈书法之所忌也。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20118,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"26a4fe1d09893e107ed6566c79940215c7d6b25d4aabbc103a0dd7d7d214818e","textSha256":"26a4fe1d09893e107ed6566c79940215c7d6b25d4aabbc103a0dd7d7d214818e","fileSha256":"26a4fe1d09893e107ed6566c79940215c7d6b25d4aabbc103a0dd7d7d214818e","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20118-work-117.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"负暄野录 · 写大字法","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/jUfro2aGUdYe1C5AQUsp44","originalPages":[391],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"253675cd5111aec2d951175279041b13c4a7e78d2b25781a0a104662700fbe93","id":"local-391-155-166","page_id":391,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":155,"rawEnd":166,"reviewedTextSha256":"1534b9f652013634096ac3126c65509cc906d2a79d43127bda8bb56c021f01d6","displayUnitOrigins":[[161,162],[162,163],[163,164],[164,165],[165,166]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":391,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T13:39:44.992Z","revision":"1534b9f652013634096ac3126c65509cc906d2a79d43127bda8bb56c021f01d6","textSha256":"1534b9f652013634096ac3126c65509cc906d2a79d43127bda8bb56c021f01d6","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":7,"end":11,"sourceTextSha256":"190f85e63123ac670cd932d478be28e2fc9b3589444b81ca57d2e4d042810a65